+ * @brief Fill the stored default subject and body of the ANNOUNCEMENT email where an
+ *   install stored them empty because the language's emails.po had no text yet.
+ *   Idempotent: a non-empty stored text is never touched, and a language whose
+ *   emails.po still has no text stays empty. A manager's own text lives in
+ *   email_templates_settings and is not touched either.
+ */
